## 12. Installation order (recommended)

| Step | Operator(s) | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | LSO → ODF | Everything else needs a StorageClass and S3 |
| 2 | OSUS | Establish upgrade path before further changes |
| 3 | COO, Loki, Logging | Capture logs during the rest of the build |
| 4 | cert-manager, External Secrets | Certificates/secrets for subsequent operators |
| 5 | GitOps | Put every CR below under Git control from here on |
| 6 | Compliance, File Integrity, SPO | Baseline scan before workloads arrive |
| 7 | RHACS | Scan mirrored images; admission in audit mode |
| 8 | OADP | Backup before onboarding tenants |
| 9 | MetalLB, NMState (SR-IOV if needed) | Workload networking |
| 10 | NFD, NMO, KMM | Hardware enablement, ops |
| 11 | Pipelines, Tempo/OTel, Service Mesh, Serverless, Virtualization | Only when a tenant requires them |
| 12 | Cluster Resource Override | After LimitRange defaults exist |
| 13 | ACM (hub cluster) | Import this cluster once stable |

Pin every Subscription to a specific channel with `installPlanApproval: Manual`, commit all YAML to the cluster-config Git repository, and let Argo CD apply it.
